      "id": 454585,
      "username": "walterrivarola",
      "name": "Walter Rivarola",
      "created_at": "2025-01-21T19:14:20.506Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yes, it is possible to have all the applications in a single site instead of multiple ones and separate them using subdomains. To achieve this, you need to use ‘multi-tenancy,’ which is exactly what you’re describing.</p>",
